# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [0.5.0]

### Added

- Added snapshot on migration so data can be restored to the original state in case of failure.

## [0.4.0]

### Added

- Added componensation for partial success migration. Now the down operation is executed for the failed data and migration is stopped.

## [0.3.0]

### Added

- Read env variables from local .env file.

## [0.2.0]

### Added

- Added custom config toml.

## [0.1.0]

### Added

- Added the capabilities to run/rollback migrations and keep track of them.

